{"suttaId":"tha-ap136","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[6105,6129],"vripara":"26"},"segments":{"tha-ap136:0.3":"Pupphacchadaniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap136:1.1":"“Sunando nāma nāmena, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;","tha-ap136:1.3":"Ajjhāyako yācayogo, vājapeyyaṃ ayājayi.","tha-ap136:2.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, aggo kāruṇiko isi;","tha-ap136:2.3":"Janataṃ anukampanto, ambare caṅkamī tadā.","tha-ap136:3.1":"“Caṅkamitvāna sambuddho, sabbaññū lokanāyako;","tha-ap136:3.3":"Mettāya aphari satte, appamāṇe [appamāṇaṃ (sī. syā.)] nirūpadhi.","tha-ap136:4.1":"“Vaṇṭe chetvāna pupphāni, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;","tha-ap136:4.3":"Sabbe sisse samānetvā, ākāse ukkhipāpayi.","tha-ap136:5.1":"“Yāvatā nagaraṃ āsi, pupphānaṃ chadanaṃ tadā;","tha-ap136:5.3":"Buddhassa ānubhāvena, sattāhaṃ na vigacchatha.","tha-ap136:6.1":"“Teneva sukkamūlena, anubhotvāna sampadā;","tha-ap136:6.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, tiṇṇo loke visattikaṃ.","tha-ap136:7.1":"“Ekārase kappasate, pañcatiṃsāsu khattiyā;","tha-ap136:7.3":"Ambaraṃsasanāmā te, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap136:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap136:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pupphacchadaniyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap136:10.1":"Pupphacchadaniyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2954,"to":2954,"paras":[{"para":2954,"vripara":"26","refs":["tha-ap136:1"],"lines":["So tena puññakammena devamanussesu sukhaṃ anubhavitvā imasmiṃ buddhuppāde sāvatthiyaṃ ekasmiṃ kulagehe nibbatto saddhājāto pabbajitvā khuraggeyeva arahattaṃ patvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>sunando nāma nāmenā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ heṭṭhā vuttanayattā suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap136:1"],["tha-ap136:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap136:1.1","sunando nāma nāmenā",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
